{"v":1,"book":"Ezek","ch":31,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And in the eleventh year, in the third month, on the first day of the month, the word of Jehovah came to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And in the "},{"t":"eleventh","s":["H0259"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[3]},{"t":", in the "},{"t":"third","s":["H7992"],"a":[4]},{"t":" month, on the "},{"t":"first","s":["H0259"],"a":[5]},{"t":" day of the "},{"t":"month","s":["H2320"],"a":[6]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" came to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[11]},{"t":","}]},{"n":2,"text":"Son of man, say to Pharaoh, the king of Egypt, and to his multitude: Whom are you like in your greatness?","tok":[{"t":"Son","s":["H1121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and to his "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H1995"],"a":[8]},{"t":": Whom are you "},{"t":"like","s":["H1819"],"a":[11]},{"t":" in your "},{"t":"greatness","s":["H1433"],"a":[12]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Indeed Assyria was a cedar in Lebanon With beautiful branches and forest shade And great height, And its top shoots were among the thick boughs.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed Assyria was a "},{"t":"cedar","s":["H0730"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Lebanon","s":["H3844"],"a":[3]},{"t":" With "},{"t":"beautiful","s":["H3303"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"branches","s":["H6057"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and forest shade And great height, And its "},{"t":"top","s":["H6788"],"a":[13]},{"t":" shoots were among the thick "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5688"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Waters nourished it, The deep springs made it grow; Its rivers flowed around The place it was planted; And it flowed out its channels To all the trees of the field.","tok":[{"t":"Waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nourished","s":["H1431"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it, The "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8415"],"a":[2]},{"t":" springs made it grow; Its "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H5104"],"a":[5]},{"t":" flowed around The place it was "},{"t":"planted","s":["H4302"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; And it flowed "},{"t":"out","s":["H7971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" its channels To all the "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Therefore its height was exalted Above all the trees of the field, And its boughs were multiplied, And its branches lengthened, Because of abundant waters, as it spread.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore its "},{"t":"height","s":["H6967"],"a":[3]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"exalted","s":["H1361"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Above all the "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And its "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5634"],"a":[8]},{"t":" were "},{"t":"multiplied","s":["H7235"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H6288"],"a":[10]},{"t":" lengthened, Because of abundant "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[11]},{"t":", as it "},{"t":"spread","s":["H7971"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"All the birds of the sky Made their nests in its boughs, And all the beasts of the field Bore their young under its branches, And in its shade All great nations dwelt.","tok":[{"t":"All the birds of the sky Made their "},{"t":"nests","s":["H7077"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in its "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5589"],"a":[0]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"all","s":["H6288"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"beasts","s":["H2416"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[10]},{"t":" Bore their "},{"t":"young","s":["H3205"],"a":[7]},{"t":" under its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H6288"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And in its shade All "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Thus it was beautiful in its greatness, In the length of its branches; For its roots were beside abundant waters.","tok":[{"t":"Thus it was beautiful in its "},{"t":"greatness","s":["H1433"],"a":[1]},{"t":", In the "},{"t":"length","s":["H0753"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H1808"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For its "},{"t":"roots","s":["H8328"],"a":[6]},{"t":" were beside abundant "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Cedars in the garden of God could not hide it; Cypresses could not compare to its boughs, And plane trees could not equal its branches; No tree in the garden of God could compare to it in its beauty.","tok":[{"t":"Cedars","s":["H0730"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1588"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[4]},{"t":" could not "},{"t":"hide","s":["H6004"],"a":[2]},{"t":" it; Cypresses could not compare to its "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5589"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And plane "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6196"],"a":[10]},{"t":" could not equal its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H6288"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; No "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1588"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[17]},{"t":" could compare to it in its "},{"t":"beauty","s":["H3308"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"I made it beautiful By the multitude of its branches, So that all the trees of Eden, Which were in the garden of God, envied it.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it "},{"t":"beautiful","s":["H3303"],"a":[0]},{"t":" By the "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H7230"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H1808"],"a":[3]},{"t":", So that all the "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Eden","s":["H5731"],"a":[7]},{"t":", Which were in the "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1588"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":", "},{"t":"envied","s":["H7065"],"a":[4]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Therefore thus says the Lord Jehovah, Because you are exalted in height — it set its top shoots among the thick boughs, and its heart is lifted up in its height —","tok":[{"t":"Therefore thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[3]},{"t":" Jehovah, Because you are exalted in "},{"t":"height","s":["H6967"],"a":[8]},{"t":" — it set its "},{"t":"top","s":["H6788"],"a":[10]},{"t":" shoots among the thick "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5688"],"a":[13]},{"t":", and its "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[15]},{"t":" is lifted "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[14]},{"t":" in its "},{"t":"height","s":["H1363"],"a":[16]},{"t":" —"}]},{"n":11,"text":"Therefore I will deliver it into the hands of the mighty one of the nations; he will surely deal with it. I have driven it out according to its wickedness.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I will "},{"t":"deliver","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" it into the "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the mighty "},{"t":"one","s":["H0410"]},{"t":" of the nations; he will "},{"t":"surely","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"deal","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with it. I have driven it "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[8]},{"t":" according to its "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7562"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"And strangers, the most ruthless of the nations, have cut it down and left it on the mountains, and its branches have fallen into all the valleys, and its boughs lie broken by all the ravines of the land; and all the peoples of the earth have abandoned its shade and left it.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"strangers","s":["H2114"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the most ruthless of the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":", have cut it "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"left","s":["H5203"],"a":[4]},{"t":" it on the "},{"t":"mountains","s":["H2022"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"its","s":["H1516"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"branches","s":["H1808"],"a":[10]},{"t":" have "},{"t":"fallen","s":["H5307"],"a":[9]},{"t":" into all the "},{"t":"valleys","s":["H1516"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and its "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H6288"],"a":[12]},{"t":" lie "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[11]},{"t":" by all the ravines of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; and all the "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[19]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[20]},{"t":" have abandoned its shade and "},{"t":"left","s":["H5203"],"a":[21]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Upon its fallen trunk All the birds of the sky will dwell, And upon its branches All the beasts of the field will be.","tok":[{"t":"Upon its fallen trunk All the birds of the sky will dwell, And upon its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H6288"],"a":[7]},{"t":" All the "},{"t":"beasts","s":["H2416"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H6288"],"a":[7]},{"t":" be."}]},{"n":14,"text":"This is so that none of the well-watered trees will exalt themselves in their height by setting their top shoots among the thick boughs, and none of the well-watered trees will stand next to them in their height; for all of them have been delivered to death, to the lowest parts of the earth among the children of men who descend into the pit.","tok":[{"t":"This is so that none of the well-"},{"t":"watered","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"exalt","s":["H1361"],"a":[3]},{"t":" themselves in their "},{"t":"height","s":["H6967"],"a":[4]},{"t":" by setting their "},{"t":"top","s":["H6788"],"a":[11]},{"t":" shoots among the thick "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H5688"],"a":[14]},{"t":", and none of the well-"},{"t":"watered","s":["H4325"],"a":[21]},{"t":" "},{"t":"trees","s":["H0352"],"a":[17]},{"t":" will stand next to them in their "},{"t":"height","s":["H1363"],"a":[18]},{"t":"; for all of them have been "},{"t":"delivered","s":["H5414"],"a":[24]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[25]},{"t":", to the lowest "},{"t":"parts","s":["H8482"],"a":[28]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[27]},{"t":" "},{"t":"among","s":["H8432"],"a":[29]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[30]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[31]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"descend","s":["H3381"],"a":[33]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"pit","s":["H0953"],"a":[34]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Thus says the Lord Jehovah, On the day it descended to Sheol I caused a mourning; I covered the deep springs for it, and I restrained its rivers, and the great waters were shut up. I also made Lebanon mourn for it, and all the trees of the field wilted on account of it.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3069"],"a":[3]},{"t":", On the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" it descended to Sheol I caused a "},{"t":"mourning","s":["H0056"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; I "},{"t":"covered","s":["H3680"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8415"],"a":[11]},{"t":" springs for it, and I "},{"t":"restrained","s":["H4513"],"a":[12]},{"t":" its rivers, and the "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[15]},{"t":" were shut up. I also made "},{"t":"Lebanon","s":["H3844"],"a":[19]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mourn","s":["H6937"],"a":[17]},{"t":" for it, and all the "},{"t":"trees","s":["H6086"],"a":[21]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[22]},{"t":" wilted on account of it."}]},{"n":16,"text":"I made the nations quake at the sound of its fall when I cast it down to Sheol with those who descend into the pit. And all the trees of Eden, the choice and best of Lebanon, all who drink water, were comforted in the lowest parts of the earth.","tok":[{"t":"I made the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"quake","s":["H7493"],"a":[2]},{"t":" at the "},{"t":"sound","s":["H6963"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of its "},{"t":"fall","s":["H4658"],"a"